reciated mastermind.\"--Publisher's description."},"tableOfContents":"Introduction: Everywhere is energy -- Born between today and tomorrow -- A glorious dream -- Reverberation of Heaven's artillery -- A whirling field of force -- As revolutionary as gunpowder was to warfare -- Order of the flaming sword -- Divine organ of sight -- Earthquakes and friends -- Fire and robots -- Like a god controlling nature's power -- Sheer audacity -- Too much of a poet and visionary -- So far ahead of his time -- Epilogue: Boldness of ignorance -- Appendix: The marvel of electricity.","note":[{"@type":"statement of responsibility","#text":"Richard Munson."},{"@type":"bibliography","#text":"Includes bibliographical references (pages 263-290) and index."}],"subject":[{"geographicCode":{"@authority":"marcgac","#text":"n-us---"}},{"@authority":"lcsh","name":{"@type":"personal","namePart":["Tesla, Nikola",{"@type":"date","#text":"1856-1943"}]}},{"@authority":"fast","name":{"@type":"personal","namePart":["Tesla, Nikola",{"@type":"date","#text":"1856-1943"}]}},{"@authority":"gnd","name":{"@type":"personal","namePart":["Tesla, Nikola",{"@type":"date","#text":"1856-1943"}]}},{"@authority":"lcsh","topic":"Electrical engineers","geographic":"United States","genre":"Biography"},{"@authority":"lcsh","topic":"Inventors","geographic":"United States","genre":"Biography"},{"@authority":"lcsh","topic":["Electrical engineering","History"]},{"@authority":"lcshac","topic":"Inventors","geographic":"United States","genre":"Biography"},{"@authority":"rvm","topic":"Ingénieurs électriciens","geographic":"États-Unis","genre":"Biographies"},{"@authority":"rvm","topic":"Inventeurs","geographic":"États-Unis","genre":"Biographies"},{"@authority":"rvm","topic":["Génie électrique","Histoire"]},{"@authority":"bisacsh","topic":["TECHNOLOGY & ENGINEERING","Engineering (General)"]},{"@authority":"fast","topic":"Electrical engineering"},{"@authority":"fast","topic":"Electrical engineers"},{"@authority":"fast","to